      "cml:integrityHash": "f582e8b1b30c2e20fd3c085ba07c6c3d932c24816c7dea4dc86250ee378e4d56",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "realizedBy": "doc:c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-73-3",
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.10",
      "skos:note": "Organising or facilitating entry of non-compliant group into foreign country is prohibited.",
      "skos:prefLabel": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "73(1) Section 73"
      },
      "wasDerivedFrom": "c2004a01078.pdf",
      "asserts": [
        "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-norm",
        "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
        "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
        "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
        "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
        "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-5"
      ],
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:integrityHash": "f610879d15c9cb5456278fdba8ecdadff7cd0a85544d146aa1581648ce1d2e43",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "realizedBy": "doc:c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1",
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "partOf": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The action is prohibited.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the first person organises or facilitates the entry of a group of at least 5 persons (the other persons) into a foreign country"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The action is prohibited.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "(b) the entry of at least 5 of the other persons into the foreign country does not comply with the requirements under that country’s law for entry into that country",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the entry of at least 5 of the other persons into the foreign country does not comply with the requirements under that country’s law for entry into that country"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The action is prohibited.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "(c) at least 5 of the other persons whose entry into the foreign country is covered by paragraph (b) are not citizens or permanent residents of the foreign country",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) at least 5 of the other persons whose entry into the foreign country is covered by paragraph (b) are not citizens or permanent residents of the foreign country"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The action is prohibited.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "(d)(i) having obtained (whether directly or indirectly) a benefit to do so",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(d)(i) having obtained (whether directly or indirectly) a benefit to do so"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The action is prohibited.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "(d)(ii) with the intention of obtaining (whether directly or indirectly) a benefit",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(d)(ii) with the intention of obtaining (whether directly or indirectly) a benefit"
    },
