      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlap",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person is taken to make a false travel or identity document if the person alters a document so as to make it a false travel or identity document (whether or not it was already a false travel or identity document before the alteration)."
    },
